1	/**
2	 * T7 — End-to-end browser QA and regression coverage
3	 *
4	 * Verifies the full workspace-tabs-data-flow integration:
5	 *   - Browser-local workspace summary lifecycle and import flow
6	 *   - Workspace switching and context updates
7	 *   - Sidebar independent active-task query (not derived from other payloads)
8	 *   - Manual sync and stale-source handling
9	 *   - Tab management: open/focus/close for task tabs and feature tabs
10	 *   - Board surface routing: board, task-tab, feature-tab
11	 *   - No GitHub direct workspace-data reads in the new workspace flow
12	 *   - Structured error codes mapped to UI error states
13	 *   - Import modal error handling for each validation code
14	 *   - Query param contract: sidebar vs task-mode vs feature-mode
15	 *   - SIDEBAR_TASK_PARAMS independence from other query builders
16	 */
